      "message": "1. We had software SHA2-384/512 support for many years (CONFIG_UPTO_SHA512)\n2. This file is linked conditionally in CONFIG_DCRYPTO_SHA512 is set\n3. When it is linked - it provides accelerated version, and you may choose to drop software implementation altogether,so sw will use hw, since unlike SHA2-256 - context is stored in memory. If it\u0027s not linked, software only versions are used.\n4. Dcrypto\u0027s support existed for long time, used by some private boards, but never used in cr50.",
